	(text "BQ25601 @ 0x6B: VAC tied to protected VBUS.\nPSEL pull-up goes to REGN (<7V), never 12V VBUS.\nR17 inhibits charging until firmware configures the cell and pulls CE low.\nR2/R3 require an external 10k pack NTC on J8 (not a fixed-temperature bypass).\nProgram 14V charger OVP before requesting a 12V PD contract.\nSet IINDPM from CC/PD policy; service or disable the watchdog deliberately.\nJ9 connects QON to GND for ship-mode exit; internal pull-up is used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 340.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "508a1233-df00-4659-a2e7-bfc765613d41")
	)
	(text "MAX17048 @ 0x36 stays on the raw cell.\nBAT_SENSE = cell / 2; allow ADC settling for 1M divider.\nGauge alert is open-drain. EP is connected to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 383.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "587b3731-484c-4413-acde-2b847c374ace")
	)
	(text "TPS63900: SEL=0, CFG3=16.2k gives 3V3.\nCFG1=36.5k, CFG2=0: 3V3 alternate setting / unlimited input mode.\nL1 >=2A saturation; verify effective Cout >=10uF at 3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 383.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a217788b-4f26-4a64-ae10-c3f476bd3662")
	)
	(text "TCPP01: enable VCC, enable UCPD Rd, then release DB.\nNo external CC Rd: the dead-battery clamp hands over to UCPD.\nR6/R7 set OVP about 13.5-15.1V; C30 is 50V X7R at U5.\nU3 pin 5 = 3V3 (USB data clamp), NEVER the 12V PD rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c4fda77d-1dce-42d4-8501-0d24d4725e68")
	)
	(text "USB-C + NVDC POWER PATH / 3V3 / FUEL GAUGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ec7afbc4-212a-4db9-a9af-5f90603e2747")
	)
